---
import SiteShell from "../components/site-shell.astro"
import Main from "../layouts/main.astro"
---

<Main
  title="Custom Ecommerce Website Development | Basilpot"
  description="Basilpot designs and develops custom ecommerce websites for international brands, including Latin America, with structured catalogues, manageable content and tailored storefronts."
  serviceType="Custom ecommerce websites"
>
  <SiteShell>
    <article>
      <h1>Ecommerce websites</h1>
      <p>
        Tasche is our ecommerce system. We use it to build custom online stores
        for brands anywhere, including Latin American brands, while reusing the
        catalogue, content and storefront infrastructure underneath.
      </p>
      <p>
        We use our own ecommerce foundation to build stores around the business
        instead of starting the underlying store system from zero every time.
      </p>
      <section>
        <h2>Products and collections</h2>
        <p>
          Products, collections and supporting content need clear relationships
          and URLs. We structure the catalogue so customers and search engines
          can navigate it properly.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Store content</h2>
        <p>
          Manage the informational and editorial pages around the catalogue.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Storefront design</h2>
        <p>
          The public website is designed around the brand instead of forcing
          every store into the same visual template.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Ash &amp; Moss</h2>
        <p>
          Ash &amp; Moss is a working demonstration of the ecommerce system: a
          custom furniture storefront with products organized by furniture type.
        </p>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/ecommerce/ash-and-moss.jpg"
            alt="Upholstered wooden armchair from the Ash and Moss storefront"
            width="1920"
            height="1200"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>
        <p>
          <a href="https://ashandmoss.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
            >Visit Ash &amp; Moss</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </SiteShell>
</Main>
